hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1158","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Malik bin Zubaid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rabaza mein Hazrat Abu Zarr ke paas se guzre to unhon ne kaha: Tum kahan se aa rahe ho, hum ne kaha: Makkah se ya Bait e Ateeq se, unhon ne kaha: Kya yehi tumhara kaam tha, hum ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: Kya us ke saath koi tijarat aur khareed o farokht to nahin thi, hum ne kaha: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: Amal dobara shuru karo."
"1159","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jo koi tasveer banaye use takleef di jayegi ke us mein phoonk mare aur use azab diya jayega aur woh us mein hargiz nahin phoonk sakega, aur jo jhoota khwab gharhe use takleef di jayegi ke do jau ke danon ke darmiyan girah lagaye aur use azab diya jayega aur woh un ke darmiyan hargiz girah nahin laga sakega, aur jo kisi qaum ki baat kaan laga kar sune jabke woh us se bhaagte hon to us ke donon kaanon mein pighla hua seesa dala jayega."
"1160","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Mudarib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Uryan bin Haitham se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Muawiya ke paas wafd ban kar aaye aur main ek ladka tha, phir jab woh un ke paas dakhil hue to unhon ne kaha: Khush aamdeed khush aamdeed, aur ek aadmi un ke saath takht par baitha hua tha, us ne kaha: Ae Ameer ul Momineen ye kaun hai jis ko aap khush aamdeed keh rahe hain, unhon ne kaha: Ye mashriq walon ke sardar hain aur ye Haitham bin Aswad hain, main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain, logon ne kaha: Ye Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas hain, main ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Fulan Dajjal kahan se niklega, unhon ne kaha: Main ne tumhare sheher walon se badh kar kisi sheher walon ko door ki cheez ke bare mein sawal karne wala aur qareeb ki cheez ko chhorne wala nahin dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Woh Iraq ki zameen se niklega jo darakhton aur khajooron wali hai."
"1161","Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abul Aaliya se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Ibn Abbas ke saath takht par baitha. Ali bin al-Jaad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Jamra se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Ibn Abbas ke saath baitha karta tha aur woh mujhe apne takht par bithate the, phir unhon ne mujh se kaha: Mere paas thehro yahan tak ke main tumhare liye apne maal mein se ek hissa muqarrar kar dun, to main un ke paas do mahine thehra."
"1162","Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus bin Bukair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Dinar Abu Khalda ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna jabke woh Basra mein ameer Hakam ke saath takht par the: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab sakht garmi hoti to namaz ko thanda kar ke padhte the aur jab sardi hoti to namaz jaldi padhte the."
"1163","Amr bin Mansoor ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Anas bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas dakhil hua jabke aap patti se bune hue takht par the, aap ke sar ke neeche chamre ka takiya tha jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi, aap ke jism aur takht ke darmiyan koi kapra nahin tha, phir Hazrat Umar aap ke paas dakhil hue to rone lage, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: Ae Umar tumhein kya rula raha hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam Ya Rasoolullah main nahin ro raha magar is liye ke main janta hun ke aap Allah ke nazdeek Kisra aur Qaisar se zyada izzat wale hain, woh donon duniya mein jis aish mein hain us mein mauj uda rahe hain aur aap Ya Rasoolullah us haal mein hain jo main dekh raha hun, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Umar kya tum is par raazi nahin ke un ke liye duniya ho aur hamare liye aakhirat ho, main ne kaha: Kyun nahin Ya Rasoolullah, aap ne farmaya: Phir baat aisi hi hai."
"1164","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Humaid bin Hilal se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Rifaa Adawi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas pahuncha jabke aap khutba de rahe the, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah ek ajnabi aadmi apne deen ke bare mein poochne aaya hai, woh nahin janta us ka deen kya hai, to aap meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur apna khutba chhor diya, phir ek kursi lai gai jis ke payon ke bare mein main ne samjha ke lohe ke hain, Humaid ne kaha: Mera khayal hai woh siyah lakdi thi use loha samjha, phir aap us par baith gaye aur mujhe us mein se sikhane lage jo Allah ne aap ko sikhaya tha, phir aap ne apne khutbe ko aakhir tak mukammal kiya."
"1165","Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Musa bin Dihqan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ibn Umar ko dulhan ke takht par baithe hue dekha jabke un par surkh kapre the, aur unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Imran bin Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Anas ko takht par baithe hue dekha jabke unhon ne ek paon doosre paon par rakha hua tha."
"1166","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Dawud bin Qais ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Saeed Maqburi ko kehte hue suna: Main Hazrat Ibn Umar ke paas se guzra aur un ke saath ek aadmi baat kar raha tha, to main un donon ki taraf ja kar khara ho gaya, to unhon ne mere seene par hath mara aur farmaya: Jab tum do aadmiyon ko baatein karte pao to un ke saath na khare ho aur na un ke saath baitho jab tak un se ijazat na le lo, to main ne kaha: Allah aap ki islah farmaye Ae Abu Abdur Rahman main ne to sirf ye ummeed ki thi ke aap donon se koi bhalai sununga."
"1167","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jo kisi qaum ki baat chhup kar sune jabke woh use napasand karte hon to us ke kaan mein pighla hua seesa dala jayega, aur jo jhoota khwab gharhe use takleef di jayegi ke jau ke dane mein girah lagaye."
"1168","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab teen aadmi hon to do aadmi teesre ko chhor kar sargoshi na karen."
"1169","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaqiq ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do aadmi teesre ko chhor kar sargoshi na karen kyunke ye baat use ghamgeen karegi."
"1170","Aur Abu Salih ne mujh se bayan kiya, woh Ibn Umar se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se usi ki misl, hum ne kaha phir agar woh chaar hon, unhon ne kaha us ko koi nuqsan nahi hoga."
"1171","Usman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Mansur se, woh Abu Wail se, woh Abdullah se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya do aadmi dusre ko chhor kar aapas me sargoshi na karen yahan tak ke logon me ghul mil jayen, is liye ke ye baat use ghamgin karti hai."
"1172","Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Aamash se, woh Abu Salih se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha jab woh chaar hon to koi harj nahi."
"1173","Imran bin Maysara ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Hafs bin Ghiyas se, woh Ashas se, woh Abu Burda bin Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha main Abdullah bin Sallam ke paas baitha, to unhon ne kaha tum hamare paas baithe ho aur hamare uthne ka waqt aa gaya hai, to main ne kaha phir jab aap chahen, to woh khare hue phir main un ke peeche chala yahan tak ke woh darwaze tak pahunch gaye."
"1174","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Qais ne mujh se bayan kiya, woh apne walid se ke woh aaye jab ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khutba de rahe the, to woh dhoop me khare ho gaye, to Aap ne unhen hukm diya to woh saye ki taraf hat gaye."
"1175","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, woh Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha Aamir bin Saad ne mujhe khabar di ke Abu Saeed al-Khudri ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne do libason aur do beon se mana farmaya, Aap ne be me mulamasa aur munabaza se mana farmaya, mulamasa ye hai ke aadmi apna kapra chhue, aur munabaza ye hai ke dusra apna kapra us ki taraf phenk de aur yehi un ki be ho baghair dekhe, aur do libason me ishtimal us samma hai, aur samma ye hai ke aadmi apne kapre ka kinara apne ek kandhe par rakh le phir us ka ek pehlu zahir ho jaye jis par kuch na ho, aur dusra libas ye hai ke aadmi baithe hue apne kapre se ehtiba kare jab ke us ki sharmgah par us me se kuch na ho."
"1176","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Amr bin Auf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Khalid bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Khalid se, woh Abu Qilaba se, unhon ne kaha Abul Malih ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha main aap ke walid Zaid ke sath Abdullah bin Amr ke paas dakhil hua, to unhon ne hum se bayan kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se mere roze ka zikr kiya gaya, to woh mere paas dakhil hue, to main ne un ke liye chamre ka takiya pesh kiya jis ka bharav lif tha, to woh zameen par baithe aur takiya mere aur un ke darmiyan ho gaya, to unhon ne mujh se farmaya kya tum ko har mahine me teen din kaafi nahi, unhon ne kaha main ne kaha Ya Rasoolallah, Aap ne farmaya paanch, main ne kaha Ya Rasoolallah, Aap ne farmaya saat, main ne kaha Ya Rasoolallah, Aap ne farmaya nau, main ne kaha Ya Rasoolallah, Aap ne farmaya gyarah, main ne kaha Ya Rasoolallah, Aap ne farmaya Dawood ke roze se upar koi roza nahi, aadhe zamane ka roza, ek din roza aur ek din iftar."
"1177","Muslim bin Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Yazid bin Khumair se, woh Abdullah bin Busr se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke walid ke paas se guzre, to unhon ne Aap ke liye qatifa dal di to Aap us par baithe."
"1178","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Abdullah bin Hassan al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha meri dono dadiyon Safiyya bint Ulayba aur Duhayba bint Ulayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, aur woh dono Qayla ki parwarda betiyan thin, ke un dono ko Qayla ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko qarfusa ki haalat me baithe hue dekha, phir jab main ne khushu wali baithak me Nabi ko dekha to khauf se main kaanp gayi."
"1179","Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Usman al-Qurashi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Dhayyal bin Ubaid bin Hanzala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mere dada Hanzala bin Hizyam ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to main ne Aap ko chaukdi maar kar baithe hue dekha."
